        <fullName>MarketingCampaignsTopic_16jKY0000004Gih</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Users who want to generate, make, create, summarize, or bootstrap their marketing campaigns or briefs should use this topic.</description>
        <developerName>MarketingCampaignsTopic_16jKY0000004Gih</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a user asks to generate/make/create/bootstrap a Brief, Campaign Brief, or Marketing Brief, ALWAYS start by calling the GenerateBrief action, ALWAYS use the users prompt for the campaign objective, ONLY present an input if the objective is not included in the users prompt. If an objective is not included in the prompt, ask for the objective in the chat, do not show an input box.</description>
            <developerName>Instruction1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>AUTOMATICALLY call the SaveBrief action after GenerateBrief</description>
            <developerName>Instruction2</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a user asks to generate/make/create/bootstrap a Campaign or Marketing Campaign without including a reference to a Brief (either in page context or history), ALWAYS start by calling the GenerateBrief action to first create and save a Brief that will be used in the GenerateCampaignFromBrief action, ALWAYS use the users prompt for the campaign objective, ONLY present an input if the objective is not included in the users prompt. If an objective is not included in the prompt, ask for the objective in the chat, do not show an input box.</description>
            <developerName>Instruction3</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction3</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a user asks to generate/make/create/bootstrap a Campaign or Marketing Campaign and they reference a specific Brief (or a Brief record in page context or history), ALWAYS start by calling the GenerateCampaignFromBrief action using the Brief that the user mentions.</description>
            <developerName>Instruction4</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction4</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>AUTOMATICALLY call the SaveCampaign action after GenerateCampaignFromBrief</description>
            <developerName>Instruction5</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction5</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>4</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>When a user asks to summarize/review/recap/outline/sum up a Campaign, ALWAYS start by calling the IdentifyRecordByName action and return the recordID.</description>
            <developerName>Instruction6</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction6</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>5</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>If an action requires a recordID or campaignID, use the IdentifyRecordByName action first to find the recordID.</description>
            <developerName>Instruction7</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction7</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>6</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
